<SiteLayout title="SingVerse · 家庭曲库，自家主场" description="SingVerse 是家庭自托管 KTV：把 NAS 曲库变成家庭 KTV：歌曲整理、原唱伴奏、电视公平轮唱、手机练唱录音、亲友扫码遥控与家庭收藏。">
<main id="main" data-pagefind-body>
<section class="hero">
<div class="container hero-grid">
<div class="hero-copy" data-reveal="">
<span class="eyebrow">家庭自托管 KTV</span>
<h1 class="hero-title">家庭曲库，<br/><em>自家主场</em></h1>
<p class="hero-lead">把 NAS 里的歌变成客厅的点歌台。电视开唱，手机点歌，亲友扫码加入，曲库自己管理，常唱的歌全家共享。</p>
<div class="hero-actions">
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/docs/getting-started.html">开始部署 <span data-icon="arrow-right"></span></a>
<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#workflow">了解使用流程</a>
</div>
<ul class="hero-meta">
<li>自备歌曲</li>
<li>数据留在 NAS</li>
<li>Android 手机 / TV</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="hero-stage" data-reveal="">
<div aria-label="产品界面预览" class="device-tabs" role="tablist">
<button aria-controls="panel-tv" aria-selected="true" class="device-tab" data-device-tab="tv" id="tab-tv" role="tab" type="button">客厅电视</button>
<button aria-controls="panel-phone" aria-selected="false" class="device-tab" data-device-tab="phone" id="tab-phone" role="tab" type="button">手机点歌</button>
