<section aria-label="四种入口" class="entry-strip">
<div class="container entry-grid">
<div class="entry-item"><span data-icon="tv"></span><div><strong>客厅电视</strong><span>大屏播放与主持</span></div></div>
<div class="entry-item"><span data-icon="smartphone"></span><div><strong>手机 App</strong><span>曲库、练唱与扫码</span></div></div>
<div class="entry-item"><span data-icon="users"></span><div><strong>亲友 H5</strong><span>扫码点歌，不用安装</span></div></div>
<div class="entry-item"><span data-icon="server"></span><div><strong>NAS 管理</strong><span>曲库、设备与系统</span></div></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section workflow" id="workflow">
<div class="container workflow-grid">
<div class="workflow-sticky" data-reveal="">
<span class="eyebrow">使用流程</span>
<h2 class="section-title">从一首歌，到一场家庭聚会</h2>
<p class="section-lead">不需要把歌曲上传到别人的服务器。部署一次，全家在同一局域网里使用。</p>
<a class="text-link" href="/docs/getting-started.html">阅读部署指南 <span data-icon="arrow-right"></span></a>
</div>
<ol class="workflow-steps">
<li class="workflow-step" data-reveal=""><span class="step-num">01</span><div><h3>部署到 NAS</h3><p>从发布者指定的 GHCR 或 Docker Hub空间拉取 Docker 镜像，启动内置管理页、亲友 H5 和下载页的 Go 主服务。</p><a class="text-link" href="/docs/getting-started.html">部署与首次登录</a></div></li>
<li class="workflow-step" data-reveal=""><span class="step-num">02</span><div><h3>导入自己的曲库</h3><p>添加本地目录或 WebDAV，扫描文件名，核对歌名、歌手和封面。原文件保持只读。</p><a class="text-link" href="/docs/library.html">曲库管理</a></div></li>
<li class="workflow-step" data-reveal=""><span class="step-num">03</span><div><h3>电视开唱</h3><p>电视登录 NAS，搜索歌曲加入待唱，新版首首入队自动开唱，亲友每人一首轮流唱，歌词和原伴按真实音轨切换。</p><a class="text-link" href="/docs/tv.html">电视端</a></div></li>
<li class="workflow-step" data-reveal=""><span class="step-num">04</span><div><h3>手机和亲友点歌</h3><p>手机 App 扫码登录电视；亲友扫邀请码打开 H5，填昵称后点歌、遥控、收藏和互动。</p><a class="text-link" href="/docs/party.html">亲友点歌</a></div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="product">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-head" data-reveal="">
<span class="eyebrow">产品功能</span>
<h2 class="section-title">为家庭长期使用而做</h2>
<p class="section-lead">不是临时投屏工具，而是一套围绕自有曲库、客厅设备和亲友聚会的完整流程。</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-row" data-reveal="">
<div class="feature-copy">
<h3>把散落的歌，整理成一份家庭曲库</h3>
<p>本地目录和 WebDAV 都能作为来源。扫描建立索引，文件名识别提取歌名歌手，平台候选逐字段审核后才应用。</p>
<ul class="feature-list">
<li><span data-icon="check"></span>本地目录与 WebDAV 来源，支持定时扫描</li>
<li><span data-icon="check"></span>文件名识别方案，待复核歌曲单独处理</li>
<li><span data-icon="check"></span>封面、歌手、分类与共享歌单</li>
<li><span data-icon="check"></span>原媒体只读，人工订正不被重扫覆盖</li>
</ul>
<a class="text-link" href="/docs/library.html">了解曲库管理 <span data-icon="arrow-right"></span></a>
</div>
<div class="feature-visual">
<div class="browser-frame">
<div class="browser-bar"><span class="browser-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="browser-url">整理 → 歌曲信息</span></div>
<div class="admin-screen">
<div class="admin-toolbar"><span class="admin-search"><span data-icon="search"></span>待审核 12 首</span><span class="admin-chip">网易云</span><span class="admin-chip">QQ</span></div>
<table class="admin-table">
<thead><tr><th>歌曲</th><th>候选</th><th>相似度</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><span class="admin-song"><span class="cover cover-4"><span>后来</span></span><span><strong>后来</strong><span>刘若英</span></span></span></td><td>后来 · 刘若英</td><td class="mono">96%</td><td><span class="status-tag is-review">待审核</span></td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="admin-song"><span class="cover cover-1"><span>茉莉花</span></span><span><strong>茉莉花</strong><span>民歌</span></span></span></td><td>茉莉花 · 群星</td><td class="mono">88%</td><td><span class="status-tag is-review">待审核</span></td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="admin-song"><span class="cover cover-3"><span>晴天</span></span><span><strong>晴天</strong><span>周杰伦</span></span></span></td><td>晴天 · 周杰伦</td><td class="mono">99%</td><td><span class="status-tag">已应用</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="admin-foot"><span>逐字段确认，不自动覆盖人工订正</span><span>审核草稿已保存</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="feature-row is-reversed" data-reveal="">
<div class="feature-copy">
<h3>原唱、伴奏，按真实音轨切换</h3>
<p>电视和网页播放器共用曲库里的音轨角色标记。伴奏未确认或未生成时不猜测，切换保留播放位置。</p>
<ul class="feature-list">
<li><span data-icon="check"></span>原唱 / 伴奏按已确认音轨或声道切换</li>
<li><span data-icon="check"></span>可选计算节点生成伴奏与兼容版本</li>
<li><span data-icon="check"></span>外置 LRC / SRT / VTT 歌词同步</li>
<li><span data-icon="check"></span>解码失败可请求 H.264 / AAC 兼容播放</li>
</ul>
<a class="text-link" href="/docs/tv.html#lyrics">歌词与音轨 <span data-icon="arrow-right"></span></a>
</div>
<div class="feature-visual">
<div class="player-card">
<div class="player-top"><div class="cover cover-2"><span>朋友</span></div><div><h4>朋友</h4><p>周华健 · 本地曲库</p></div></div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="waveform" data-waveform="">
<i style="height:30%"></i><i style="height:55%"></i><i style="height:80%"></i><i style="height:45%"></i><i style="height:65%"></i><i style="height:90%"></i><i style="height:50%"></i><i style="height:70%"></i><i style="height:40%"></i><i style="height:85%"></i><i style="height:60%"></i><i style="height:35%"></i><i style="height:75%"></i><i style="height:55%"></i><i style="height:95%"></i><i style="height:45%"></i><i style="height:65%"></i><i style="height:30%"></i><i style="height:80%"></i><i style="height:50%"></i><i style="height:70%"></i><i style="height:40%"></i><i style="height:60%"></i><i style="height:35%"></i>
</div>
<div class="player-controls">
<div aria-label="音轨切换示意" class="track-toggle" role="group">
<button aria-pressed="true" data-track="original" type="button">原唱</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" data-track="accompaniment" type="button">伴奏</button>
</div>
<span class="player-time">02:14 / 05:02</span>
</div>
<p class="player-note">当前：<span data-track-label="">原唱</span> · 示意界面，实际可用性取决于音轨标记与伴奏生成</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="feature-row" data-reveal="">
<div class="feature-copy">
<h3>亲友扫码，不用装 App</h3>
<p>电视常驻本场邀请二维码。亲友用微信或浏览器打开 H5，填昵称确认后加入。每人一首轮唱，自己的歌保持点歌顺序；不用争抢遥控器。</p>
<ul class="feature-list">
<li><span data-icon="check"></span>邀请链接确认后才加入，凭据只属于本场</li>
<li><span data-icon="check"></span>搜索、歌手、最近、热门与家庭收藏</li>
<li><span data-icon="check"></span>公平轮唱、临时插队、进度遥控和原伴纠正</li>
<li><span data-icon="check"></span>点赞、鼓掌和喝彩，电视无音效互动</li>
</ul>
<a class="text-link" href="/docs/party.html">亲友点歌指南 <span data-icon="arrow-right"></span></a>
</div>
<div class="feature-visual">
<div class="party-demo">
<div class="party-demo-head"><h4>客厅聚会</h4><span>演示 · 同一队列</span></div>
<div class="demo-song"><div class="cover cover-3"><span>晴天</span></div><div class="demo-song-copy"><strong>晴天</strong><span>周杰伦 · 04:29</span></div><button class="btn btn-primary btn-small" data-demo-add="" type="button"><span data-icon="plus"></span>加入待唱</button></div>
